<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>读书笔记 - 第九章·无讼 / 第十章·无为政治</title>
<style>
  * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  body {
    background-color: #e6e6e6;
    font-family: "Kaiti", "STKaiti", "KaiTi_GB2312", "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 20px;
    color: #2b2b2b;
  }

  /* Notebook Page Container */
  .page {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 760px;
    min-height: 1020px;
    background-color: #fcfcfc;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    border-radius: 4px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* Left Margin Column (Cornell Style Margin) */
  .left-margin {
    width: 65px;
    border-right: 1.5px solid #c8ccd0;
    padding: 20px 8px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #7f8c8d;
    background-color: #fafafa;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  /* Main Grid Area */
  .grid-area {
    flex-grow: 1;
    position: relative;
    padding: 15px 45px 30px 20px;
    background-size: 26px 26px;
    background-image: 
      linear-gradient(to right, rgba(180, 195, 210, 0.35) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(180, 195, 210, 0.35) 1px, transparent 1px);
    line-height: 26px;
  }

  /* Ring Binder Holes on the Right Edge */
  .binder-holes {
    position: absolute;
    right: 8px;
    top: 55px;
    bottom: 30px;
    width: 22px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .hole {
    width: 15px;
    height: 15px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: #e6e6e6;
    border: 1px solid #c0c0c0;
    box-shadow: inset 1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
  }

  /* Typography & Layout */
  .chapter-title {
    font-size: 34px;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #2c3e50;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    margin-top: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    font-family: "STKaiti", "KaiTi", "SimSun", serif;
  }

  .section {
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .item {
    position: relative;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    font-size: 16.5px;
    line-height: 26px;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    color: #1a1a1a;
  }

  /* Number Badges */
  .badge {
    display: inline-block;
    background-color: #6b7770;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 13px;
    padding: 0 4px;
    height: 18px;
    line-height: 18px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    margin-right: 6px;
    vertical-align: middle;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .badge-sub {
    background-color: #5c6b73;
    padding: 0 5px;
    font-size: 12px;
    height: 17px;
    line-height: 17px;
  }

  /* Highlight Effects */
  .hl-yellow {
    background: linear-gradient(transparent 20%, rgba(254, 240, 138, 0.85) 20%, rgba(254, 240, 138, 0.85) 85%, transparent 85%);
    padding: 0 2px;
  }

  .annotation-above {
    position: absolute;
    right: 25px;
    top: -14px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #2b2b2b;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .indent-1 {
    padding-left: 28px;
  }

  .indent-sub {
    margin-left: 20px;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  p {
    word-break: break-all;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
  <!-- Left Cornell Column -->
  <div class="left-margin">
    <div class="note-label">备注:</div>
    <div class="summary-label">总结:</div>
  </div>

  <!-- Grid Main Content -->
  <div class="grid-area">

    <!-- Chapter 9 -->
    <div class="section">
      <h1 class="chapter-title">第九章·无讼</h1>

      <div class="item indent-1">
        <p>
          <span class="badge">一</span>“讼师”向“律师”的称呼改变，意味着<span class="hl-yellow">礼治社会向</span>
        </p>
        <p>
          <span class="hl-yellow">法治社会的转变。</span>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="item indent-1">
        <p>
          <span class="badge">二</span>当社会结构和思想观念未能适应法治的时候，贸然
        </p>
        <p>
          推行法治下乡，一方面会破坏原有的礼治秩序，另一方
        </p>
        <p>
          面还不能建立起有效的法治秩序，使人们对法治
        </p>
        <p>
          产生抵触。
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Chapter 10 -->
    <div class="section" style="margin-top: 15px;">
      <h1 class="chapter-title">第十章·无为政治</h1>

      <div class="item indent-1" style="position: relative;">
        <span class="annotation-above">长期</span>
        <p>
          <span class="badge">一</span>皇权（<span class="hl-yellow">横暴权力</span>）受到小农经济的限制，无法进行大规
        </p>
        <p>
          模工程，所以会采用“无为”的方式来“养民”。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="item">
        <p>
          <span class="badge">二</span>研究权力要从两方面着眼。
        </p>

        <!-- Sub 1 -->
        <div class="indent-sub">
          <p>
            <span class="badge badge-sub">1</span><span class="hl-yellow">社会冲突&#x21D2;横暴权力：</span>在上下有别的权力统治下，人们达到了休战
          </p>
          <p style="padding-left: 26px;">
            状态中的临时平衡，但这不是冲突的消弭。
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Sub 2 -->
        <div class="indent-sub" style="margin-top: 8px;">
          <p>
            <span class="badge badge-sub">2</span><span class="hl-yellow">社会合作&#x21D2;同意权力：</span>每个人为了维持自己的生活状态，不得不做好
          </p>
          <p style="padding-left: 26px;">
            自己的分内工作，同时要求别人做好他们的分内工作，这
          </p>
          <p style="padding-left: 26px;">
            就<span class="hl-yellow">产生了权利和义务</span>。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <!-- Binder Punch Holes -->
  <div class="binder-holes">
    <div class="hole"></div>
    <div class="hole"></div>
    <div class="hole"></div>
    <div class="hole"></div>
    <div class="hole"></div>
    <div class="hole"></div>
    <div class="hole"></div>
